# CLAUDE.local.md.example

Copy to `CLAUDE.local.md` for personal, machine-specific notes. That file is gitignored and is read in
addition to `CLAUDE.md`, so keep it to overrides and local facts — not a second copy of the shared guidance.

Do not put API keys, tokens or passwords here. `--discover` reads `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` from the environment;
set it in your shell, not in this file.

Examples of what belongs here:

```markdown
## Local setup
- Repo lives at <path>; run everything through `uv run` from the repo root with PYTHONPATH=.
- Personal inputs (CVs, connections CSV, referral export) are registered in jobfit/config.py — mine live at
  <paths on this machine>.

## Preferences for this machine
- Don't start long update runs without asking; a full pass takes ~40 minutes here.
- Default to the fast test subset; run the full suite only before a commit.

## Scratch
- Current focus: <what you're in the middle of>
- Companies to re-check by hand: <names>
```
